@keys language reference c89 syntax
 Language topics

 The C language as implemented by Flash C. With the cursor on a
 keyword or operator in the editor press Ctrl+F1 to jump to its topic;
 in a topic, Edit|Copy example copies the program into an edit window.

## Keywords

  {auto} {break} {case} {char} {const} {continue} {default} {do}
  {double} {else} {enum} {extern} {float} {for} {goto} {if} {int} {long}
  {register} {return} {short} {signed} {sizeof} {static} {struct}
  {switch} {typedef} {union} {unsigned} {void} {volatile} {while}
  {Extended keywords}

