  {Arithmetic operators} {Relational and logical operators}
  {Bitwise and shift operators} {Assignment operators}
  {Increment and decrement} {Conditional operator} {Comma operator}
  {Address and indirection operators} {Member access operators}
  {Cast operator} {Operator precedence} {Expressions} {Type conversions}

## Types and constants

  {Data types} {Integer types} {Integer constants} {Floating constants}
  {Character constants and escape sequences} {Strings} {Pointers}
